The number $218_9$ can be converted to base 10 as follows:
$$218_9 = 2 \cdot 9^2 + 1 \cdot 9^1 + 8 \cdot 9^0$$
$$= 2 \cdot 81 + 1 \cdot 9 + 8 \cdot 1$$
$$= 162 + 9 + 8$$
$$= 179$$

Similarly, the number $5_9$ can be converted to base 10 as follows:
$$5_9 = 5 \cdot 9^0$$
