Therefore, the resulting complex number is $\sqrt{2}(-3 - 8i)\left(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2} + i\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}\right).$

Expanding this expression, we get $-3 - 8i + 6i + 8 = -3 + 6i + 8 = 5 + 2i.$

